Package: tagmodr
Type: Package
Title: Iterative Codebook Development for Taguette QDA Projects
Version: 0.3.0
Authors@R: person("Shimpei", "Morimoto", role = c("aut", "cre"),
    email = "mrmt.shmp@gmail.com")
Description: R pipeline for iterative codebook development on Taguette
    (<https://www.taguette.org/>) qualitative-analysis projects. Reads a
    Taguette SQLite export, materialises the tag hierarchy into a
    per-highlight review table, applies user-authored rename / merge /
    unlink / add / apply operations from an Excel workbook, and writes
    a new SQLite for re-import. Supports Unicode (Japanese) tag paths
    and uses exact-match semantics resilient to regex-metacharacter
    hazards.
